  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conference on UNCAC Sept 10 2009 cofinanced with the Government Offices, The Institute against Bribery, Transparency International Sweden. Sidas constribution is dedicated to travel and lodging costs for speakers from UNODC and Peru. Objective: Makin the UNCAC known to a wider group of Swedish actors within Public Administration, develoment cooperation, academia, private sector and civil society.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konferens om FNs anti-korruptionskonvention 10 sept 2009 i samarbete med Regeringskansliet, Institutet mot mutor och Transparency International, Sverige. Sidas bidrag g&#xe5;r till resekostnader och hotell f&#xf6;r tillresta talare fr&#xe5;n UNODC och Peru. M&#xe5;l: G&#xf6;ra FN-konventionen k&#xe4;nd i en bredare krets i Sverige inom f&#xf6;rvaltning, bist&#xe5;nd, universitet, den privata sektorn och civila samh&#xe4;llet.</narrative>
